; A 40 x 20 x 4 plate (x -20..20) with a 6 mm hole through it at the origin, pulled
; along x by 1000 N (12.5 MPa gross, 17.9 net). Yield 250 but 60 in a strip
; x 0.10..0.12 across the plate, through the hole's edge where the stress
; concentrates. On cells of 1 mm the strip is between reads (flagged and bounded);
; the hole's peak is under-read on cells that coarse.
; truth: safe fails about 1.41 (60 / 42.65 MPa read at the strip on 0.25 and 0.125 mm cells; Peterson's net Kt 2.36 x 17.9 = 42.1)
(import "std")
(def part (max (box 40 20 4) (- 3 (sqrt (+ (* x x) (* y y))))))
(study s (shape part)
 (elastic (E 200000MPa) (nu 0.3) (yield (* 1MPa (select (max (- 0.10 x) (- x 0.12)) 60 250))))
 (fix root (+ x 19)) (load pull (force 1000N 0 0) (region (- 19 x))) (res 1))
(require safe (min-safety-factor s > 1.5))
